docs {
  Créer / agir — `POST /api/sanctions`

  Permission requise : aucune (clé valide)

  Corps JSON :
  - `type` ("ban" | "kick" | "timeout" | "warn" | "restrict") — obligatoire
  - `userId` (string) — obligatoire
  - `reason` (string)
  - `duration` (string | null)
  - `scope` ("network" | "local")
  - `originGuildId` (string | null)
  - `profile` (string | null)
  - `deleteMessageSeconds` (0 | 3600 | 86400 | 604800)
}
